text\n- No pending questions or unresolved requests.\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nUser requested an exact reply of “BETA” and explicitly prohibited tool use.\n\n## Early Progress\n- No work performed; the request was a single constrained response instruction.\n- No tools were invoked.\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- The retained suffix requires compliance with the exact output “BETA” and no tool use."}}]}],["add","q","main",null,{"id":"q","k":"toast","p":{"text":"Session compacted 1 time","ttl":2400,"role":"omp.toast.status"}}],["set","j.line/input",{"sendable":true}],["del","0"],["del","2"],["settle","o"],["settle","p"],["settle","q"]]}}
